---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy and Disclaimer | FranchiseVista"
  description="FranchiseVista privacy policy and investment disclaimer. Franchise investments carry risk. Nothing here promises returns, income or success."
>

<section class="hero hero-sub on-dark" aria-labelledby="h1">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-in">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1 id="h1">Privacy and Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated November 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="privacy-h">
  <div class="wrap prose">

    <h2 id="privacy-h">Privacy</h2>

    <h3>What we collect</h3>
    <p>When you fill in a form on this website we collect the information you provide: your name, mobile number, email address, city, and any message text. We may also collect standard server log data such as your IP address and browser type.</p>

    <h3>How we use it</h3>
    <p>We use your contact details to call or email you in connection with the enquiry you made. We do not share your details with any brand or third party without your consent. We do not sell personal data.</p>

    <h3>Your choices</h3>
    <p>To ask us not to contact you, or to request deletion of your data, email <a href="mailto:franchisevista@growthoriginator.in">franchisevista@growthoriginator.in</a> or call <a href="tel:+919667395517">+91 96673 95517</a>. We will act on your request within a reasonable time.</p>

    <h3>Messaging</h3>
    <p>By providing your mobile number you agree that we may contact you by call or SMS in relation to your enquiry. Standard message rates from your carrier may apply. This website is not affiliated with or endorsed by WhatsApp or Meta.</p>

    <h2 id="disclaimer-h">Disclaimer</h2>

    <div class="card card-pale callout" role="note" aria-label="Important disclaimer">
      <strong>Franchise investments carry risk.</strong> You may lose some or all of the money you invest. Past performance of a brand does not guarantee your results. Nothing on this website is financial advice or a promise of income, return or success.
    </div>

    <ul>
      <li>Investment figures shown on this website are indicative, exclude GST and are set by each brand. They may change without notice.</li>
      <li>FranchiseVista is a consulting and lead-generation intermediary. We are not a party to any franchise agreement and are not responsible for the performance of any brand or franchisee.</li>
      <li>We make reasonable efforts to ensure the information on this website is accurate, but we do not guarantee it is complete, current or error-free.</li>
      <li>Links to third-party websites are provided for convenience. We have no control over those sites and accept no responsibility for their content.</li>
      <li>Before signing any franchise agreement you should take independent legal and financial advice.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>If you have questions about this policy write to us at <a href="mailto:franchisevista@growthoriginator.in">franchisevista@growthoriginator.in</a>.</p>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .prose { max-width:720px; }
  .prose h2 { margin:48px 0 16px; font-size:28px; }
  .prose h3 { margin:28px 0 10px; font-size:18px; }
  .prose p, .prose li { line-height:1.75; color:#374151; }
  .prose ul { padding-left:24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; }
  .callout { padding:24px 28px; margin:24px 0; }
</style>

</Layout>
